    "name": "Falsafah Tot API",
    "description": "Backend for the Falsafah Tot B2B marketplace (Express + MongoDB). Import the companion 'Falsafah Tot - Local' environment alongside this collection. Requests are ordered so that running each folder top-to-bottom (or Runner over the whole collection) chains tokens/ids automatically via test scripts into environment variables.",
